      "EpisodeMasterId": 2001402,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 22,
      "SpeakerName": "静香",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "所以我很自然地开口了。我想，我们只是单纯地想享受演剧。/n正是为了这个，我才诞生。",
      "BackgroundCharacterImageFileName": "140450_0",
      "VoiceFileName": "20014020200",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "102"
